- Now grants +30% Bonus Damage on successful parry (affects all damage, similar to the base parry amplification)

##item:restorative-locket: [[!:https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/items/vitality/restorative_locket.webp]] Restorative Locket

- No longer scales with Spirit Power (0.17)
- Now scales with Boons (0.3)

##item:return-fire: [[!:https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/items/vitality/return_fire.webp]] Return Fire

- Bullet Resistance increased from 6% to 8%

##item:ricochet: [[!:https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/items/weapon/ricochet.webp]] Ricochet

- No longer targets zipline targets

##item:rusted-barrel: [[!:https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/items/spirit/rusted_barrel.webp]] Rusted Barrel

- Cast range increased from 23m to 28m
- Bullet Resistance reduction increased from -5% to -6%

